{%- comment -%}
  Renders the cart icon.

  Source: phase-3-assets/icons/icon-cart.svg, drawn in Phase 3 to the Phase 2
  contract — 24x24 canvas, stroke 1.5, currentColor, round caps and joins.
  A shopping bag rather than a trolley, which suits an apparel store and matches
  the approved mockup.

  Accepts:
  - class: {String} optional extra class names

  Usage:
  {% render 'icon-cart' %}

  Decorative: the wrapping link carries the accessible name and the item count.
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg class="icon icon--cart {{ class }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5.5 7.75h13l-1.1 11.3a1.4 1.4 0 0 1-1.4 1.2H8a1.4 1.4 0 0 1-1.4-1.2Z"/><path d="M9 10V6.9a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V10"/></svg>
